@startuml pool-state-channels
!include _theme.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
title Pool-state update channels
caption Worker is the only Redis writer. Numbers match the Architecture page.

actor "On-chain activity" as Chain
participant "Arc RPC" as RPC
box "chakra-market-data-worker"
  participant Bootstrap as Boot
  participant "Log watcher" as LW
  participant "Fetch pipeline" as FP
  participant "DEX adapters" as AD
  participant Discovery as Disc
end box
database Redis
participant "api-server" as API

Boot -> Redis : 1. publish topology +\nfull pool state
LW -> RPC : 2. eth_subscribe logs\ninclusion is final
Chain -> RPC : swap / mint / burn
LW -> RPC : 3. eth_getLogs fallback\nevery 500 ms · topic0 batches of 10
LW -> FP : 3. touched pools
FP -> AD : 4. fetch touched pools
AD -> RPC : eth_call
FP -> Redis : 5. SET (CLMM only if\ncoverage complete)
Disc -> Redis : 6. discovery ~600 s\nfull republish
API -> Redis : 7. reload last snapshot
API -> Redis : 7. MGET on candidate paths

@enduml
